<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Beatrix Sept qtr profit jumps.</title>
<headline>Beatrix Sept qtr profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distrib profit		  37.42 vs 34.42</p>
<p>    Capital spending		34.31 vs 43.69</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 590,000 vs 594,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		3,825 vs   3,801</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		    6.5 vs 6.4</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		 30,905 vs 28,434</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	    53,365 vs 51,941</p>
<p>Full name: Beatrix Mines Ltd, owned by Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
